# GitHub Linguist Overrides for Vyavahaar
# Enforce accurate language detection across all platforms matching Streak

*.dart linguist-detectable=true
*.kt linguist-detectable=true
*.swift linguist-detectable=true
*.cpp linguist-detectable=true
*.cc linguist-detectable=true
*.h linguist-detectable=true
*.cmake linguist-detectable=true
CMakeLists.txt linguist-detectable=true
*.iss linguist-detectable=true

# Mark documentation and scripts so they do not skew programming language percentages
docs/** linguist-documentation=true
scripts/** linguist-documentation=true
*.md linguist-documentation=true
